   "paper_id": "1910.09982",
   "group_id": "1910.09982::s00",
   "concise_text": "The winning team ltuorp used an attention transformer using BERT trained on Wikipedia and BookCorpus and chose parameters on the development set and a subset of the training set to improve robustness.",
